{"version":1,"key":"card:45","content":{"id":45,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":":where()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 伪类的优先级是 0，无论其参数内的选择器优先级多高。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"75016059-760b-4d97-9325-510147f1cc03","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":":is()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 伪类的优先级是由括号内选择器的优先级决定的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"09e67a86-fbce-460a-939f-ff759b9df810","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在 Vue 等框架中使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":":is()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 伪类，选择器就不会再增加随机属性选择器。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3206d44b-9176-4572-b624-3c174767a4bb","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":":is()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 伪类正式支持是 Chrome88 开始的，也就是 21 年 1 月份，到现在已经快 2 年了，那些对兼容性要求不高的项目可以放心大胆使用，如果非要兼容陈旧浏览器，可以使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":":-webkit-any()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 伪类兼容下，除了选择器的优先级不一样外（","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":":any()","type":"formatted"},{"text":"伪类的优先级恒定为类选择器优先级，忽略里面的参数），其他功效是一样的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"29c3d5fe-ae63-47a8-b17a-a858d1e28bd3","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["CSS/选择器"],"createTime":1688999134336,"updateTime":1793532515569,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532515569}}